cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "iRazer — open-source Razer control for macOS"
message: "If you use or reference iRazer, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
abstract: >-
  iRazer is a free, open-source native macOS application that controls Razer
  devices (RGB lighting, EQ, volume, brightness, power) without Razer Synapse —
  a Synapse alternative for Apple Silicon and Intel Macs. The first supported
  device is the Razer Nommo V2.
authors:
  - name: "hanley-tech and iRazer contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hanley-tech/iRazer"
url: "https://github.com/hanley-tech/iRazer"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - razer
  - macos
  - razer synapse alternative
  - razer chroma
  - apple silicon
  - rgb
  - razer nommo v2
